system.backup.pushDialogMessage:
Tracked changes will be committed and pushed ONLY to the personal remote:
{url}

.env, users.json, sessions.json, certs/, and other ignored files are never uploaded.

system.backup.pullDialogMessage:
Code will be fetched from the personal remote:
{url}

Only fast-forward is allowed: if your local history diverged, nothing is forced. Uncommitted local changes are kept safe in a stash that is reapplied. If there is an update, the server restarts on its own (the page reloads).
